#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:111
#, xml-text
msgid "Kernel Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração do Núcleo"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:115
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There used to be a conflict between the <application>Cups</application> "
"<application>libusb</application> backend and the usblp kernel driver.  This"
" is no longer the case and cups will work with both of these enabled."
msgstr ""
"Costumava existir um conflito entre a estrutura de retaguarda "
"<application>libusb</application> do <application>Cups</application> e o "
"controlador de núcleo usblp. Esse não mais é o caso e o CUPS funcionará com "
"ambos habilitados."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:123
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you want to use the kernel usblp driver (for example, if you wish to use "
"<application>escputil</application> from <xref linkend=\"gutenprint\"/>) "
"enable the following options in your kernel configuration and recompile the "
"kernel:"
msgstr ""
"Se você quiser usar o controlador usblp do núcleo (por exemplo, se desejar "
"usar o <application>escputil</application> oriundo do <xref "
"linkend=\"gutenprint\"/>), habilite as seguintes opções na configuração do "
"teu núcleo e recompile o núcleo:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:133
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have a parallel printer, enable the following options in your kernel "
"configuration and recompile the kernel:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver uma impressora paralela, habilite as seguintes opções na "
"configuração do teu núcleo e recompile o núcleo:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:141 blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:376
#, xml-text
msgid "cups"
msgstr "cups"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:147
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Cups"
msgstr "Instalação do Cups"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:150
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You will need to add an <systemitem class=\"username\">lp</systemitem> user,"
" as <application>Cups</application> will create some files owned by this "
"user. (The <systemitem class=\"username\">lp</systemitem> user is the "
"default used by <application>Cups</application>, but may be changed to a "
"different user by passing a parameter to the <command>configure</command> "
"script.) Use the following command as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Você precisará adicionar um(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">lp</systemitem>, pois o <application>Cups</application> "
"criará alguns arquivos de propriedade desse usuário. (O(A) usuário(a) "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">lp</systemitem> é o padrão usado pelo "
"<application>Cups</application>, mas pode ser mudado para um(a) usuário(a) "
"diferente passando-se um parâmetro para o conjunto de comandos sequenciais "
"<command>configure</command>). Use o seguinte comando como o(a) usuário(a) "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:159
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>useradd -c \"Print Service User\" -d /var/spool/cups -g lp -s "
"/bin/false -u 9 lp</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>useradd -c \"Usuário(a) do Serviço de Impressão\" -d "
"/var/spool/cups -g lp -s /bin/false -u 9 lp</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:162
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"You will also need a dedicated group that will contain users allowed to do "
"<application>Cups</application> administrative tasks. Add the group by "
"running the following command as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Você também precisará de um grupo dedicado que conterá usuários(as) "
"autorizados(as) a realizar tarefas administrativas do "
"<application>Cups</application>. Adicione o grupo executando o seguinte "
"comando como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:168
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>groupadd -g 19 lpadmin</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>groupadd -g 19 lpadmin</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:171
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you want to add a user to the <application>Cups</application> "
"administrative group, run the following command as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você deseja adicionar um(a) usuário(a) ao grupo administrativo do "
"<application>Cups</application>, execute o seguinte comando como o(a) "
"usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:176
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>usermod -a -G lpadmin "
"<replaceable>&lt;username&gt;</replaceable></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>usermod -a -G lpadmin "
"<replaceable>&lt;nome_usuário(a)&gt;</replaceable></userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:179
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you didn't install <xref linkend=\"xdg-utils\"/>, use the following "
"<command>sed</command> to change the default browser that will be used to "
"access the <application>Cups</application> web interface:"
msgstr ""
"Se você não instalou o <xref linkend=\"xdg-utils\"/>, use o seguinte "
"<command>sed</command> para mudar o navegador padrão que será usado para "
"acessar a interface web do <application>Cups</application>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:184
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -i 's#@CUPS_HTMLVIEW@#firefox#' "
"desktop/cups.desktop.in</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -i 's#@CUPS_HTMLVIEW@#firefox#' "
"desktop/cups.desktop.in</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:187
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Replace <command>firefox</command> with the web browser of your choice."
msgstr ""
"Substitua <command>firefox</command> pelo navegador da web da tua escolha."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:192
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Build <application>Cups</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Construa o <application>Cups</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:195
#, no-wrap, xml-text
#| msgid ""
#| "<userinput>./configure --libdir=/usr/lib            \\\n"
#| "            --disable-systemd            \\\n"
#| "            --with-rcdir=/tmp/cupsinit   \\\n"
#| "            --with-rundir=/run/cups      \\\n"
#| "            --with-system-groups=lpadmin \\\n"
#| "            --with-docdir=/usr/share/cups/doc-&cups-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
#| "make</userinput>"
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --libdir=/usr/lib            \\\n"
"            --with-rcdir=/tmp/cupsinit   \\\n"
"            --with-rundir=/run/cups      \\\n"
"            --with-system-groups=lpadmin \\\n"
"            --with-docdir=/usr/share/cups/doc-&cups-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --libdir=/usr/lib            \\\n"
"            --with-rcdir=/tmp/cupsinit   \\\n"
"            --with-rundir=/run/cups      \\\n"
"            --with-system-groups=lpadmin \\\n"
"            --with-docdir=/usr/share/cups/doc-&cups-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:202
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --libdir=/usr/lib            \\\n"
"            --with-rundir=/run/cups      \\\n"
"            --with-system-groups=lpadmin \\\n"
"            --with-docdir=/usr/share/cups/doc-&cups-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>./configure --libdir=/usr/lib            \\\n"
"            --with-rundir=/run/cups      \\\n"
"            --with-system-groups=lpadmin \\\n"
"            --with-docdir=/usr/share/cups/doc-&cups-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:209
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>LC_ALL=C make -k check</command>. An "
"already active graphical session with bus address is necessary to run the "
"tests.  Make sure that there is not other instance of "
"<application>Cups</application> running, otherwise at least 4 tests will "
"fail with \"address in use\"."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>LC_ALL=C make -k check</command>."
" Uma sessão gráfica já ativa com endereço de barramento é necessária para se"
" executar os testes. Certifique-se de que não exista outra instância do "
"<application>Cups</application> executando, caso contrário, pelo menos "
"quatro (4) testes falharão com \"address in use\"."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:216
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#.  dev note: make BUILDROOT=<DESTDIR>
#.  install
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:221
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -svnf ../cups/doc-&cups-version; /usr/share/doc/cups-&cups-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make install &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -svnf ../cups/doc-&cups-version; /usr/share/doc/cups-&cups-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:225
#, xml-text
msgid "Remove the shipped bootscript, which is incompatible with LFS:"
msgstr ""
"Remova o conjunto fornecido de comandos sequenciais de inicialização, o qual"
" é incompatível com o LFS:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:228
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>rm -rf /tmp/cupsinit</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>rm -rf /tmp/cupsinit</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:231
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Create a basic <application>Cups</application> client configuration file by "
"running the following command as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Crie um arquivo de configuração básica de cliente do "
"<application>Cups</application> executando o seguinte comando como o(a) "
"usuário(a) <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:236
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>echo \"ServerName /run/cups/cups.sock\" > "
"/etc/cups/client.conf</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>echo \"ServerName /run/cups/cups.sock\" > "
"/etc/cups/client.conf</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:244
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:247
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-rcdir=/tmp/cupsinit</parameter>: This switch tells the "
"build process to install the shipped bootscript into <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/tmp</filename> instead of <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/etc/rc.d</filename>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-rcdir=/tmp/cupsinit</parameter>: Essa chave informa ao "
"processo de construção para instalar o conjunto fornecido de comandos "
"sequenciais de inicialização em <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/tmp</filename> em vez de <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/etc/rc.d</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:254
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-rundir=/run/cups</parameter>: This switch prevents the "
"package from referring to the deprecated <filename "
"class='directory'>/var/run</filename> directory."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-rundir=/run/cups</parameter>: Essa chave impede o pacote "
"de referenciar o diretório obsoleto <filename "
"class='directory'>/var/run</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:260
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-system-groups=lpadmin</parameter>: This switch ensures "
"that only <systemitem class=\"groupname\">lpadmin</systemitem> will be used "
"as the <application>Cups</application> administrative group."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-system-groups=lpadmin</parameter>: Essa chave garante que "
"somente o <systemitem class=\"groupname\">lpadmin</systemitem> será usado "
"como o grupo administrativo do <application>Cups</application> ."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:266
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--disable-libusb</option>: Use this switch if you have installed "
"<xref linkend=\"libusb\"/>, but wish to use the kernel usblp driver."
msgstr ""
"<option>--disable-libusb</option>: Use essa chave se você tiver instalado o "
"<xref linkend=\"libusb\"/>, mas desejar usar o controlador usblp do núcleo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:271
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--enable-libpaper</option>: Use this switch if you have installed "
"<application>libpaper</application> and wish to use it with "
"<application>Cups</application>."
msgstr ""
"<option>--enable-libpaper</option>: Use essa chave se você tiver instalado a"
" <application>libpaper</application> e desejar usá-lo com o "
"<application>Cups</application>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:279
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring Cups"
msgstr "Configurando o Cups"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:282
#, xml-text
msgid "Config Files"
msgstr "Arquivos de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/pst/printing/cups.xml:285
#, xml-text
msgid "<filename>/etc/cups/*</filename>"
